Fixed non-Latin labels (for example Chinese, Japanese, or Cyrillic) collapsing to the key `a` when deriving `CustomField.key`, `ComputedField.key`, `Relationship.key`, and `GitRepository.slug`. Such labels are now transliterated, so `設備名稱` derives `she_bei_ming_cheng` rather than colliding with every other non-Latin label. This affects newly derived keys only; existing stored keys are untouched.
